			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Remove deprecated transport layers and RPC scaffolding\n\nUpdate the Element submodule pointer to ddf572e3.\n\n**Common** (refactor): Delete the deprecated `Effect` module and all transport implementation modules (gRPC, IPC, WASM, Registry, Metrics, Retry, CircuitBreaker) along with their DTO components. Keep only core modules (Environment, Error) and the Common transport interface.\n\n**Mountain** (refactor): Eliminate unused module declarations including legacy `Hover`, `DefaultConfigurations`, `NLSResolver`, the `Enhanced` subdirectory, and 11 dormant RPC scaffolding modules (Types, EchoAction, Commands, Workspace, Configuration, Windows, Terminals, Debug, SCM, Processes, Telemetry). Condense `Source/RPC/mod.rs` documentation to describe only the active `CocoonService` surface.\n\nThis cleanup removes dead code following the architectural migration to new IPC and telemetry patterns, reducing noise in the module tree and ensuring only actively-used paths remain in scope.",
