			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Normalize import separations in Vine and Git handlers\n\nUpdate the Element submodule pointer to 39f31afa, which advances the Mountain submodule to 54102e9d.\n\nMountain completes the absolute-path migration by normalizing import statement formatting in `Source/Vine/Server/Initialize.rs` and `Source/Vine/Server/MountainVinegRPCService.rs`, applying the established two-line pattern to separate `::Vine::Error` and `::Vine::Generated` type imports from local `crate::` bindings.\n\nGit service handlers in `Source/IPC/WindServiceHandlers/Git/` receive consistent single-line consolidated imports for local modules in `HandleRevListCount` and `HandleRevParse`. Multi-line `uuid::Uuid::new_v4()` calls in `HandleExec` and `HandleRevParse` expand to block style for improved readability.\n\nThis finalizes import normalization across all gRPC service handlers, ensuring consistent separation between canonical library imports and local project bindings.",
