			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Collapse multi-line use declarations in Air\n\nUpdate the Element submodule pointer to 908a87c6, which advances the Air submodule to 1e06bf0c.\n\nAir normalizes import formatting across all 15 AirServiceProvider method modules by collapsing multi-line `use` statements into single-line declarations. Affected modules include Authenticate, ApplyUpdate, CheckForUpdates, DownloadFile, DownloadStream, DownloadUpdate, GetConfiguration, GetFileInfo, GetMetrics, GetResourceLimits, GetStatus, IndexFiles, SearchFiles, SetResourceLimits, and UpdateConfiguration.\n\nThis continues the recent style pass that also collapsed function signatures and documentation comments, reducing vertical noise while preserving all functionality.",
